puddle doctor (puddle 0.1.0, windows x86_64)

FAIL  CPU virtualization          off in the firmware (UEFI/BIOS)
      impact: Puddle can't start any workspace: the CPU's virtualization feature is turned off.
      remedy: Turn on CPU virtualization in the PC's UEFI/BIOS setup, then start the PC again.
      fix:    Turn on CPU virtualization in your PC's UEFI/BIOS setup (Intel: "Intel
              Virtualization Technology" / VT-x; AMD: "SVM Mode"), save, and start the PC again.
FAIL  Hypervisor                  Windows Hypervisor Platform is on, but the hypervisor can't run: CPU virtualization is off
